    'examprep.starters.desc':   { vi: 'Khởi động: động từ to be, this/that/these/those, there is/are cơ bản, giới từ in/on/under, can', en: 'Getting started: to be, this/that/these/those, basic there is/are, in/on/under, can', ja: 'はじめの一歩：to be、this/that/these/those、there is/are、in/on/under、can', zh: '入门：to be、this/that/these/those、基础there is/are、in/on/under、can', ar: 'البداية: to be، this/that/these/those، there is/are الأساسي، in/on/under، can' },
